- Update to 0.6.2:
  * Hold functions weakly in the caches keyed by function so
    resolved functions no longer stay alive for the life of the
    process (new uncalled_for.caching FunctionCache, closes #21)

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Nov 11 12:58:05 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.6.1:
  * A CallArgument naming a parameter the outer function does not
    declare now becomes a keyword-only parameter of the outer
    signature instead of requiring the outer function to declare
    an argument it never uses

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Fri Nov  6 07:48:29 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.6.0:
  * Support Annotated dependencies for providing values
  * Add a Provided default and resolve dependencies through
    type aliases
  * Support Python 3.11 through 3.15, drop Python 3.10

