Wed Nov  4 11:36:41 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.4.2:
  * Restore the shared scope when dependency cleanup fails, so
    a failing exit or cancellation no longer leaks a closed
    scope into later calls
  * Annotate contextmanager helpers as Generator instead of
    Iterator (type-only, no runtime change)

